Deletes: A suspended coroutine's stack given back after the debug library wrote to it (`return_stack`), and the barrier of `borrow_stack`, which parks the running stack in the thread with no safe point before `return_stack` and so covers the store on its own.
Tests: debug_setlocal_in_a_suspended_coroutine

diff --git a/crates/orbit-runtime/src/vm/coro.rs b/crates/orbit-runtime/src/vm/coro.rs
